{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2023-04-04 08:00:00', 'title': 'GEORGIA NATURAL GAS® AND LENOX SQUARE HOST ANNUAL EARTH DAY ELECTRONICS RECYCLING EVENT', 'text': "ATLANTA , APRIL 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GEORGIA RESIDENTS AND BUSINESSES HAVE A CONVENIENT AND RESPONSIBLE WAY TO RECYCLE THEIR UNWANTED ELECTRONICS THIS COMING EARTH DAY. GEORGIA NATURAL GAS (GNG), GEORGIA'S LEADING NATURAL GAS PROVIDER, IS PARTNERING WITH LENOX SQUARE AND EWASTE EPLANET,\xa0AN R2.V3 CERTIFIED ELECTRONICS RECYCLING AND DATA DESTRUCTION PROVIDER, TO HOST AN ELECTRONIC RECYCLING EVENT IN THE DINING PAVILION PARKING LOT AT LENOX SQUARE SATURDAY, APRIL 22 FROM 9 A.M."}